# Cac file shell script phai luon co line ending LF, khong phu thuoc core.autocrlf
# cua tung may. Neu khong, tren Windows Git se tu chuyen LF -> CRLF khi checkout,
# lam hong dong shebang (#!/bin/sh\r) va khien Docker bao loi
# "exec /app/entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory" khi build image tu working tree.
*.sh text eol=lf
